   Wright, Robyn J.; Langille, Morgan G., I, Dalhousie Univ, Fac Med, Dept Pharmacol, Halifax, NS, Canada.
   Langille, Morgan G., I, Dalhousie Univ, Dept Microbiol \& Immunol, Halifax, NS, Canada.},
