   Zheng, YG; Zheng, KY (Corresponding Author), Int Joint Res Ctr Resource Utilizat \& Qual Evaluat, Shijiazhuang, Peoples R China.
   Tian, Qian; Gu, Xian; Wang, Qian; Zhang, Dan; Ma, Donglai; Xue, Zijing; Lu, Zikang; Kong, Yaxing; Zheng, Yuguang; Zheng, Kaiyan, Hebei Univ Chinese Med, Coll Pharm, Tradit Chinese Med Proc Technol Innovat Ctr Hebei, Shijiazhuang, Peoples R China.
