   Simon, Alois; Katzensteiner, Klaus, Univ Nat Resources \& Life Sci Vienna, Inst Forest Ecol, Dept Forest \& Soil Sci, Vienna, Austria.
   Simon, Alois, Off Tyrolean Govt, Tyrol Forest Adm, Dept Forest Planning, Innsbruck, Austria.
