   Fitterer, Jessica L.; Nelson, Trisalyn A., Univ Victoria, Dept Geog, Spatial Pattern Anal \& Res Lab, Victoria, BC V8W 3R4, Canada.
   Coops, Nicholas C., Univ British Columbia, IRSS, Dept Forest Resources Management, Vancouver, BC V6T 1Z4, Canada.
   Wulder, Michael A., Nat Resources Canada, Pacific Forestry Ctr, Canadian Forest Serv, Victoria, BC V8Z 1M5, Canada.},
