   Martin, Maxence; Fenton, Nicole J.; Girona, Miguel Montoro; Bergeron, Yves; Valeria, Osvaldo, Univ Quebec Abitibi Temiscamingue, Forest Res Inst, Rouyn Noranda, PQ, Canada.
