   Wall, Jake; Sairowua, Wilson; Goss, Marc, Mara Elephant Project, Narok, Kenya.
   Deninger-Snyder, Kristen; Mbise, Noel, Grumeti Fund, Mugumu Serengeti, Tanzania.
   Tiedeman, Kate, Max Planck Inst Anim Behav, Constance, Germany.
   Ndambuki, Stephan; Eblate, Ernest, Wildlife Res \& Training Inst, Naivasha, Kenya.
   Eblate, Ernest, Tanzania Wildlife Res Inst, Arusha, Tanzania.
