   Stock, A (Corresponding Author), Columbia Univ, Earth Inst, Lamont Doherty Earth Observ, Palisades, NY 10964 USA.
   Stock, A., Stanford Univ, Emmett Interdisciplinary Program Environm \& Resou, Stanford, CA 94305 USA.
   Haupt, A. J., Calif State Univ Monterey Bay, Sch Nat Sci, Seaside, CA 93955 USA.
